The "notes" field must specifically explain the "State Chemical" value proposition (e.g. "Needs automated scenting for lobby").
NEVER return an empty list if grounding tools provide data. Synthesize a response.`;

  const userPrompt = `Generate a Prospect Intelligence Report for: ${locationQuery}.
Industry Filter: ${params.subSegment || params.segment || 'All Commercial/Industrial'}.

Provide the list as a valid JSON array. Identify specific apartment buildings, manufacturing sites, and schools.`;

  try {
